stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Draft
  Draft --> Scripting : topic confirmed
  Scripting --> AwaitingApproval : script generated
  AwaitingApproval --> Scripting : creator requests rewrite
  AwaitingApproval --> Rendering : hook approved + commentary added
  Rendering --> Rendering : scene retry
  Rendering --> Failed : attempts exhausted
  Failed --> Rendering : admin re-run
  Rendering --> Checking : assembly complete
  Checking --> Blocked : originality below threshold
  Blocked --> AwaitingApproval : creator adds original input
  Checking --> Ready : guard passed
  Ready --> Scheduled : publication scheduled
  Ready --> Downloaded : downloaded without publishing
  Scheduled --> Publishing : scheduled time reached
  Publishing --> Scheduled : quota backoff
  Publishing --> Published : upload succeeded
  Published --> Measuring : first metrics received
  Measuring --> Measuring : nightly snapshot
  Downloaded --> [*]
  Measuring --> [*]
